Aim

To develop an online real estate system for searching, viewing, and booking properties according to location and budget.

Algorithm
Start the program.
Register and log in to the system.
Search for properties by location, price, and type.
View property details, images, and map locations.
Save favorite properties and search criteria.
Contact agents and schedule property visits.
Admin manages property listings, agents, advertisements, and customer records.
Stop the program.
Result

Thus, the online real estate system was designed to help users find suitable properties based on their location and budget and manage property listings efficiently.
